      "writtenOn": "2021-04-27T22:09:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case this code will only run on kernel version 3.7 and later: is this perhaps a protection against reentrancy? I think that commit dbf2576e37da (\"workqueue: make all workqueues non-reentrant\") made such protections superfluous.",
